# Local plaintext secret values for the sops-operator design (modules/
# kubernetes/_secrets-lib.nix) — read at Nix-eval time and immediately
# re-encrypted via nixidy's postProcess before anything is committed; the
# plaintext itself must never touch git.
/secrets/values/
